{
  "name": "slices",
  "unit": "slice",
  "about": "A slice is a unit of reading: a part of Django's source cut where the fewest imports cross, to be read whole in one sitting. The book's first pass reads the source a slice at a time. A slice is not a department of the book; those are assigned in their own file, in the same grammar.",
